   416|        <div class="highlight-box">
   417|            <h3>💰 What Affects Your Total Cost?</h3>
   418|            <p>Your final price depends on:</p>
   419|            <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
   420|                <li><strong>Number of grafts:</strong> 1,000 grafts (minor restoration) vs. 3,000+ grafts (significant baldness)</li>
   421|                <li><strong>Technique:</strong> FUE, DHI, or non-shaved FUE (latter costs 20-30% more)</li>
   422|                <li><strong>Clinic reputation:</strong> Established chains like Lotus charge 10-20% more but have better track records</li>
   423|                <li><strong>Surgeon involvement:</strong> Chief physicians command higher fees</li>
   424|                <li><strong>Package inclusions:</strong> Some quotes include hotel, airport transfer, medications; others don't</li>
   425|            </ul>
   426|        </div>
   427|    </section>
